			"notes": "## WebProfileViewer 1.4.7\n\nA major modernization update for Minecraft 1.21.11.\n\n### New and improved\n\n- Modernized the player statistics fetching system based on the newer Stats Fetcher implementation.\n- Improved `/web` and `/weball` player queries.\n- Added Bed Wars team detection, team-colored results, and team-grouped `/weball` output.\n- Added an option to skip your own team during in-game queries.\n- Added automatic player querying when a Bed Wars game starts.\n- Added configurable dangerous-player FKDR thresholds.\n- Added configurable statistic fields, copy buttons, and copy-language options.\n- Improved handling and presentation of nicked players, rate limits, network errors, and other failed requests.\n- Added and refined English and Simplified Chinese translations.\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Restored the normal Minecraft screen background.\n- Restored both large and small AntiAFK HUD icons.\n- Improved Bed Wars scoreboard and roster parsing, including eight-team modes.\n- Preserved fallback behavior when team information cannot be resolved.\n\n### Internal changes\n\n- Refactored and modularized the statistics fetching, formatting, configuration, and Bed Wars detection code.\n- Removed development `run/` files from version control.\n\nAntiAFK remains available. Features unrelated to player statistics, such as Fireball Helper, are not included."
